"text":"That gives about 17.8 shots, 3.1 threes, 7.4 assists and 3.2 turnovers in 33 minutes. FG% dips a little on the extra volume, and his FTA stays near the base because his Clippers free throw rate was low.","sources":["stats"]},{"field":"mpg","text":"The experts expect about 32 to 33 minutes if he is healthy. I keep 33.","sources":["https://youtu.be/tnzmsYUA4yQ?t=461"]},{"field":"late_games_out","text":"His toe and knee history plus a no-pick team adds a small March rest risk. The team has few back-to-backs and will not tank.","sources":["https://youtu.be/tnzmsYUA4yQ?t=432","https://youtu.be/tnzmsYUA4yQ?t=2040"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}